The AppImage bundles Python, PyGObject, GTK, libadwaita and additional runtime
libraries under their respective licenses. Native components include json-c
and OpenSSL. The AppImage Type-2 runtime incorporates additional open-source
components. See docs/THIRD_PARTY.md, the pinned build-input lockfiles, and the
artifact's dependency inventory and license texts for corresponding sources
and notices. Host graphics drivers, Unity's normal GTK3 runtime and the desktop's
Xwayland are supplied separately. No private Xwayland bridge is bundled.

